(3551164, 498143, 61396, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea. The double meaning of the title works with the support of both red/black colors and freckles. I only wish the bugs were a little bigger and more in focus (that is, if one must compensate, then I would focus on the smaller bugs, rather than on the child)</td>', 'Excellent idea. The double meaning of the title works with the support of both red/black colors and freckles. I only wish the bugs were a little bigger and more in focus (that is, if one must compensate, then I would focus on the smaller bugs, rather than on the child)', '2007-04-16 08:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
