(3551263, 497139, 76585, '<td valign="top">wow not only a great shot, what an interesting little fellow.</td>', 'wow not only a great shot, what an interesting little fellow.', '2007-04-16 09:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551268, 498074, 76585, '<td valign="top">beautiful pic</td>', 'beautiful pic', '2007-04-16 09:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551278, 496086, 76585, '<td valign="top">I like it, interesting perspective.</td>', 'I like it, interesting perspective.', '2007-04-16 09:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551284, 498126, 25728, '<td valign="top">The title makes this photo. Good job.</td>', 'The title makes this photo. Good job.', '2007-04-16 09:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551289, 498070, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''re being told spiders aren''t insects.  No points counted off by me. Nice detail.  He''s creepy!!</td>', 'I''m sure you''re being told spiders aren''t insects.  No points counted off by me. Nice detail.  He''s creepy!!', '2007-04-16 09:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551290, 498081, 43463, '<td valign="top">Fabulous amount of fine detail can be seen in this photograph - right down to the legs of the ladybugs. Lighting is fabulous everything is illuminated perfectly. The color tones of the red and green and bold and vibrant. A very eye-catching photo.</td>', 'Fabulous amount of fine detail can be seen in this photograph - right down to the legs of the ladybugs. Lighting is fabulous everything is illuminated perfectly. The color tones of the red and green and bold and vibrant. A very eye-catching photo.', '2007-04-16 09:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551291, 497091, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the narrow DOF.</td>', 'I like the narrow DOF.', '2007-04-16 09:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551293, 498064, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice detailing.  I even like that you can see the window of the building behind. Sets up a nice story.  Great focus on the buzzing guy. 7</td>', 'Nice detailing.  I even like that you can see the window of the building behind. Sets up a nice story.  Great focus on the buzzing guy. 7', '2007-04-16 09:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551296, 497839, 25728, '<td valign="top">Ugh. Either thats a mighty big lens your toting, or you are a brave brave soul.  Hopefully this honeybee swarm moved on to its new digs by now...</td>', 'Ugh. Either thats a mighty big lens your toting, or you are a brave brave soul.  Hopefully this honeybee swarm moved on to its new digs by now...', '2007-04-16 09:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551297, 495814, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - I can almost hear his wings!!! Great detail and focus.</td>', 'WOW - I can almost hear his wings!!! Great detail and focus.', '2007-04-16 09:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551299, 497287, 76585, '<td valign="top">I think this is an overall great shot. DOF,color and clarity.</td>', 'I think this is an overall great shot. DOF,color and clarity.', '2007-04-16 09:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551303, 498070, 25728, '<td valign="top">Cute titling, ugly spider. Blah.</td>', 'Cute titling, ugly spider. Blah.', '2007-04-16 09:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551304, 496312, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and DOF!!</td>', 'Nice focus and DOF!!', '2007-04-16 09:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551305, 497832, 15711, '<td valign="top">Delicate.  WOW - the moth "matches" the flower. ;~D</td>', 'Delicate.  WOW - the moth "matches" the flower. ;~D', '2007-04-16 09:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551307, 498133, 15711, '<td valign="top">Terrific dof. I like the gray/blue bokeh as well. In a perfect scenario, the leaf in the foreground wouldn''t have had that blur, but what an ya do? Good luck.</td>', 'Terrific dof. I like the gray/blue bokeh as well. In a perfect scenario, the leaf in the foreground wouldn''t have had that blur, but what an ya do? Good luck.', '2007-04-16 09:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551310, 498124, 25728, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is especially creepy and suits this nasty thing well. I''m having flashbacks of these things hitting my windshield in VA year before last.  ew ew ew.</td>', 'The lighting here is especially creepy and suits this nasty thing well. I''m having flashbacks of these things hitting my windshield in VA year before last.  ew ew ew.', '2007-04-16 09:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551311, 497135, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE - you used a straw, I used an envelope. LOL  CUTE!!! He almost appears to be smiling. The background is rather "dull" but the focus on the bug is good.</td>', 'HEE HEE - you used a straw, I used an envelope. LOL  CUTE!!! He almost appears to be smiling. The background is rather "dull" but the focus on the bug is good.', '2007-04-16 09:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551316, 497287, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the whir of the wings. If it were allowed, I''d say crop out the dark red to the right, but considering, not bad.  The focus on the bee is great.</td>', 'I like the whir of the wings. If it were allowed, I''d say crop out the dark red to the right, but considering, not bad.  The focus on the bee is great.', '2007-04-16 09:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551318, 497453, 43463, '<td valign="top">What is absolutely stunning about this shot is the level of detail and gorgeous coloring on that green butterfly in the forefront! It looks like it has little sparkling jewels on it''s wings. Love the colors and lighting on this one - and the title goes very well with the action in the photograph too:-) The other two butterflies in the background are not as in sharp focus as the one on the foreground but that is too be expected when doing a macro/extreme close-up. If anytime in the future you do wish to get a greater DOF where both the background and foreground are in sharp focus and get lots of detail all you need is a tripod, a higher aperature setting (F8 or higher), and slower shutter speed.</td>', 'What is absolutely stunning about this shot is the level of detail and gorgeous coloring on that green butterfly in the forefront! It looks like it has little sparkling jewels on it''s wings. Love the colors and lighting on this one - and the title goes very well with the action in the photograph too:-) The other two butterflies in the background are not as in sharp focus as the one on the foreground but that is too be expected when doing a macro/extreme close-up. If anytime in the future you do wish to get a greater DOF where both the background and foreground are in sharp focus and get lots of detail all you need is a tripod, a higher aperature setting (F8 or higher), and slower shutter speed.', '2007-04-16 09:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551319, 496817, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - you must have an amazing zoom/macro combination.  Great shot.</td>', 'WOW - you must have an amazing zoom/macro combination.  Great shot.', '2007-04-16 09:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551324, 497832, 25728, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh a Luna Moth. I''m impressed you found one, I haven''t been able to catch one of these since I was a kid. Can''t wait to see it with the saturation bumped up afterwards. Good job.</td>', 'Ohhhh a Luna Moth. I''m impressed you found one, I haven''t been able to catch one of these since I was a kid. Can''t wait to see it with the saturation bumped up afterwards. Good job.', '2007-04-16 09:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551328, 497476, 15711, '<td valign="top">Must be some sort of beetle.  COOL shell!!  I like the minimalism and the screen. Good focus and DOF.</td>', 'Must be some sort of beetle.  COOL shell!!  I like the minimalism and the screen. Good focus and DOF.', '2007-04-16 09:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551329, 497769, 76585, '<td valign="top">lol</td>', 'lol', '2007-04-16 09:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551330, 497290, 25728, '<td valign="top">Crystal sharp in what appears to be slightly overcast light in the green house. Nice capture, love how the bokeh with the orange flowers to the left brings the composition together.</td>', 'Crystal sharp in what appears to be slightly overcast light in the green house. Nice capture, love how the bokeh with the orange flowers to the left brings the composition together.', '2007-04-16 09:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551333, 497418, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love all the level of details in this extreme close-up of this ant - right down to the tiny hairs on it''s legs and body. This really gives us an up close and personal view of this tiny creature. Lighting is wonderful for the subject and it''s environment are illuminated very well.</td>', 'Love all the level of details in this extreme close-up of this ant - right down to the tiny hairs on it''s legs and body. This really gives us an up close and personal view of this tiny creature. Lighting is wonderful for the subject and it''s environment are illuminated very well.', '2007-04-16 09:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551334, 497278, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and zoom.  He almost has a long snout like an ant eater.  In a perfect scenario, I''d bump up the green background, but good job for no editing.</td>', 'Nice focus and zoom.  He almost has a long snout like an ant eater.  In a perfect scenario, I''d bump up the green background, but good job for no editing.', '2007-04-16 09:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551339, 497904, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - amazing macro/zoom action.  The detail is really good.</td>', 'WOW - amazing macro/zoom action.  The detail is really good.', '2007-04-16 09:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551344, 498017, 25728, '<td valign="top">Maybe you could have filtered the flash just a tad knowing it was minimal editing, but I think it could be easily remedied with editing after challenge. I would have over-exposed this myself during a regular rule set to capture detail and toned it down in RAW later on myself, so I see the merits of this exposure. A really good shot. Original and nicely composed.</td>', 'Maybe you could have filtered the flash just a tad knowing it was minimal editing, but I think it could be easily remedied with editing after challenge. I would have over-exposed this myself during a regular rule set to capture detail and toned it down in RAW later on myself, so I see the merits of this exposure. A really good shot. Original and nicely composed.', '2007-04-16 09:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551345, 498017, 76585, '<td valign="top">great perspective!</td>', 'great perspective!', '2007-04-16 09:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551346, 495997, 15711, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF.  Terrific zoom/macro.  One of the better ones.  If I could change a thing, I''d play with the background color, but with no editing.....  GOOD JOB. 8</td>', 'Excellent DOF.  Terrific zoom/macro.  One of the better ones.  If I could change a thing, I''d play with the background color, but with no editing.....  GOOD JOB. 8', '2007-04-16 09:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551348, 497837, 43463, '<td valign="top">Nice details in this close-up of this ladybug - love how you can see all the details on this insect from it''s tiny legs to the spots on it''s shell. This photo really gives us an up close and personal view of this ladybug. Congrats on catching it crawling on the greenery - this little creatures can move really fast when one is still trying to focus:-) Lighting is wonderful for the subject and it''s environment are illuminated very well.</td>', 'Nice details in this close-up of this ladybug - love how you can see all the details on this insect from it''s tiny legs to the spots on it''s shell. This photo really gives us an up close and personal view of this ladybug. Congrats on catching it crawling on the greenery - this little creatures can move really fast when one is still trying to focus:-) Lighting is wonderful for the subject and it''s environment are illuminated very well.', '2007-04-16 09:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551352, 495996, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and soft greens.  What type of butterfly is that??</td>', 'Nice DOF and soft greens.  What type of butterfly is that??', '2007-04-16 09:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551353, 497091, 25728, '<td valign="top">Your control of the DOF here is a marvel. What an absolute pain in the rear this must have been trying to get the right area to show clear and probably quickly with what appears to be a live insect. Nice work.</td>', 'Your control of the DOF here is a marvel. What an absolute pain in the rear this must have been trying to get the right area to show clear and probably quickly with what appears to be a live insect. Nice work.', '2007-04-16 09:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551354, 497190, 25728, '<td valign="top">Good control of the lighting, and very nice perspective. Nice to see something different!</td>', 'Good control of the lighting, and very nice perspective. Nice to see something different!', '2007-04-16 09:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551356, 498126, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on the bug.  Perfect title.  Too bad you couldn''t crop out the blob of the flower.  Love the bokeh.</td>', 'Nice focus on the bug.  Perfect title.  Too bad you couldn''t crop out the blob of the flower.  Love the bokeh.', '2007-04-16 09:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551360, 496595, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely bokeh. I like the criss crossing of the grasses.</td>', 'Lovely bokeh. I like the criss crossing of the grasses.', '2007-04-16 09:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551361, 495356, 42181, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, IMO a distracting background. Great focus on the eye.</td>', 'Nice picture, IMO a distracting background. Great focus on the eye.', '2007-04-16 09:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551364, 495690, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - that bokeh is killer.  Love the diagonal line of the leaf.  Nice.</td>', 'WOW - that bokeh is killer.  Love the diagonal line of the leaf.  Nice.', '2007-04-16 09:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551368, 497291, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Great DOF and detail on the butterfly. I like the angle of the wings.</td>', 'Very nice.  Great DOF and detail on the butterfly. I like the angle of the wings.', '2007-04-16 09:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551372, 497328, 15711, '<td valign="top">This may have the best focus of any entry I''ve seen.  Well done.  The zoom/macro is excellent.</td>', 'This may have the best focus of any entry I''ve seen.  Well done.  The zoom/macro is excellent.', '2007-04-16 09:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551374, 498121, 15711, '<td valign="top">Terrific.  Love the stop action.  Beautiful bokeh as well.  Bravo.</td>', 'Terrific.  Love the stop action.  Beautiful bokeh as well.  Bravo.', '2007-04-16 09:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551375, 496621, 43463, '<td valign="top">There are some wonderful details in this close-up of this ladybug. I love how you can see all the details on this insect from it''s tiny legs hanging onto the flower to the black spots on it''s shell. My congrats on freezing the action with so much lovely detail on the ladybug - It is surprising how fast these little creatures can move when one is still trying to focus:-) The lighting is wonderful for the subject and it''s environment are illuminated perfectly.</td>', 'There are some wonderful details in this close-up of this ladybug. I love how you can see all the details on this insect from it''s tiny legs hanging onto the flower to the black spots on it''s shell. My congrats on freezing the action with so much lovely detail on the ladybug - It is surprising how fast these little creatures can move when one is still trying to focus:-) The lighting is wonderful for the subject and it''s environment are illuminated perfectly.', '2007-04-16 09:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551376, 497336, 76409, '<td valign="top">Very clear...love the light shining off the leaves...bug looks dead though!</td>', 'Very clear...love the light shining off the leaves...bug looks dead though!', '2007-04-16 09:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551378, 498182, 76585, '<td valign="top">Great perspective! I wonder what they''re getting ready to do...........lol!</td>', 'Great perspective! I wonder what they''re getting ready to do...........lol!', '2007-04-16 09:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551383, 498079, 66575, '<td valign="top">ew!  awesome!</td>', 'ew!  awesome!', '2007-04-16 09:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551394, 494852, 66575, '<td valign="top">to be honest, i''m GLAD to see so many bees!  read the latest news about them and you might think they''d all but vanished.</td>', 'to be honest, i''m GLAD to see so many bees!  read the latest news about them and you might think they''d all but vanished.', '2007-04-16 09:52:47.000000', NULL, 1);
