(3551456, 496986, 43463, '<td valign="top">Oh wow! First off, wonderfully captured details in the bee! And the colors in the photograph are wonderfully vibrant. Great capture in the action - this little bee really does appear to be ''holding'' on for dear life forgetting that it has wings and can simply just fly off. Love that little gleam in the eye for it projects the ''spark'' of life in the insect.</td>', 'Oh wow! First off, wonderfully captured details in the bee! And the colors in the photograph are wonderfully vibrant. Great capture in the action - this little bee really does appear to be ''holding'' on for dear life forgetting that it has wings and can simply just fly off. Love that little gleam in the eye for it projects the ''spark'' of life in the insect.', '2007-04-16 10:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
