(3551499, 495997, 43463, '<td valign="top">Very nice details in this close-up of this ladybug - love how you can see some fine detail on this insect such as the tiny ''face''. Congrats on catching it crawling on the greenery - these little creatures can move surprisingly fast when one is still trying to focus:-) Lighting is wonderful for the subject and it''s environment are illuminated very well.</td>', 'Very nice details in this close-up of this ladybug - love how you can see some fine detail on this insect such as the tiny ''face''. Congrats on catching it crawling on the greenery - these little creatures can move surprisingly fast when one is still trying to focus:-) Lighting is wonderful for the subject and it''s environment are illuminated very well.', '2007-04-16 10:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
