(3551511, 497834, 43463, '<td valign="top">Beautiful details on the butterfly! I absolutely love the bold &amp; vibrant orange hue of the spread wings of the butterfly and the flowers it rests on. The colors really leap off the page. Great composition to wait or capture the butterfly with it''s wings spread open for that is generally where all those lovely bold hues are.</td>', 'Beautiful details on the butterfly! I absolutely love the bold & vibrant orange hue of the spread wings of the butterfly and the flowers it rests on. The colors really leap off the page. Great composition to wait or capture the butterfly with it''s wings spread open for that is generally where all those lovely bold hues are.', '2007-04-16 10:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
