(3551581, 497930, 53147, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great shot. Love the focus and detail. What I am struggling with is that this looks cropped, beyond the squarness of it you seem to have a white bar on the bottom of the image that look slike you cropped beyond the image canvas. I am sure I amnot the first (and probably not the last) to point this out. If it is cropped its a shame, cause I really think you caught some great detail on the face of your butterfly.</td>', 'I think this is a great shot. Love the focus and detail. What I am struggling with is that this looks cropped, beyond the squarness of it you seem to have a white bar on the bottom of the image that look slike you cropped beyond the image canvas. I am sure I amnot the first (and probably not the last) to point this out. If it is cropped its a shame, cause I really think you caught some great detail on the face of your butterfly.', '2007-04-16 10:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3551588, 498045, 68256, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if a "doodle" bug is an insect or not, but after trying to photo some myself this past week and having the little boogers roll up and roll away all I can say is WOW.  What a great capture of the little buger! - 9</td>', 'I don''t know if a "doodle" bug is an insect or not, but after trying to photo some myself this past week and having the little boogers roll up and roll away all I can say is WOW.  What a great capture of the little buger! - 9', '2007-04-16 10:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
