(3552250, 497960, 43463, '<td valign="top">Oh MY...the creativity in this one is great! It also made me smile:-) Love the attention to detail and the details in this one. Lighting and focus are fabulous. I can see the details of the hairs on the dragonfly''s legs! Love the hat and scarf you adorned on your model...I wonder how happy the dragonfly was with the get-up:-)Oh and the legs (''arms'') of the dragonfly ''appear'' to be wrapping around the scarf &amp; it''s body as if it is shivering and seeking to warm itself up - it''s that attention to detail that helps make this shot an above average one.</td>', 'Oh MY...the creativity in this one is great! It also made me smile:-) Love the attention to detail and the details in this one. Lighting and focus are fabulous. I can see the details of the hairs on the dragonfly''s legs! Love the hat and scarf you adorned on your model...I wonder how happy the dragonfly was with the get-up:-)Oh and the legs (''arms'') of the dragonfly ''appear'' to be wrapping around the scarf & it''s body as if it is shivering and seeking to warm itself up - it''s that attention to detail that helps make this shot an above average one.', '2007-04-16 13:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
