(3561313, 495048, 50289, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming the little brown spec at the center of the picture is your insect.  However, I would be hard pressed to guess what it is.  The main focal point in your shot appears to be the cactus, not an insect.</td>', 'I''m assuming the little brown spec at the center of the picture is your insect.  However, I would be hard pressed to guess what it is.  The main focal point in your shot appears to be the cactus, not an insect.', '2007-04-18 22:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3561317, 497944, 50289, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Would have been better if it was closer to the insect.  I know you may have been limited by your lens.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Would have been better if it was closer to the insect.  I know you may have been limited by your lens.', '2007-04-18 22:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3561433, 498070, 52130, '<td valign="top">not an insect</td>', 'not an insect', '2007-04-18 23:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3561647, 498135, 18367, '<td valign="top">I truly do like this image and have score it in the upper level. Having said this, I do believe you might have garnered additional points with a tighter crop, particularly on the right hand side of the image.  Good luck.</td>', 'I truly do like this image and have score it in the upper level. Having said this, I do believe you might have garnered additional points with a tighter crop, particularly on the right hand side of the image.  Good luck.', '2007-04-19 00:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3561653, 495996, 18367, '<td valign="top">Great image, wonderful DOF and bokeh.  Although I did score this fairly high, from a personal preference a tighter crop would have garnered an additional point from me.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Great image, wonderful DOF and bokeh.  Although I did score this fairly high, from a personal preference a tighter crop would have garnered an additional point from me.  Good Luck.', '2007-04-19 00:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3561849, 497256, 36235, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite picture in the entire challenge.  Post-challenge I''ll be very interested to see how you set this photo up.  Only things I can nitpick about are the glare off the back of the bee and the grayish background at the bottom-left (solid green would have been better).</td>', 'This is my favorite picture in the entire challenge.  Post-challenge I''ll be very interested to see how you set this photo up.  Only things I can nitpick about are the glare off the back of the bee and the grayish background at the bottom-left (solid green would have been better).', '2007-04-19 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3561854, 495690, 36235, '<td valign="top">Superb colors (love the green/red contrast, as well as the red in the background complimenting the red in the butterfly).  Also love the composition with the diagonal leaf.</td>', 'Superb colors (love the green/red contrast, as well as the red in the background complimenting the red in the butterfly).  Also love the composition with the diagonal leaf.', '2007-04-19 01:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3561857, 497290, 36235, '<td valign="top">Love the colors, and the title really fits the picture well.  I wish the background was more out of focus, or more green instead of white.</td>', 'Love the colors, and the title really fits the picture well.  I wish the background was more out of focus, or more green instead of white.', '2007-04-19 01:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3562122, 496100, 70484, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail! I love that the lighting draws attention to the wings and that the head and body are in the shadow a little more. Very nice capture!</td>', 'Amazing detail! I love that the lighting draws attention to the wings and that the head and body are in the shadow a little more. Very nice capture!', '2007-04-19 04:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3562155, 497832, 58991, '<td valign="top">I like the soft pastel colors. Great images. 10</td>', 'I like the soft pastel colors. Great images. 10', '2007-04-19 05:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
