(3562218, 497837, 70484, '<td valign="top">The composition is great. The only thing I notice is the flash on the shell. I know it is difficult, but maybe a screen in front of the flash would help.</td>', 'The composition is great. The only thing I notice is the flash on the shell. I know it is difficult, but maybe a screen in front of the flash would help.', '2007-04-19 06:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
