(3565608, 497418, 69368, '<td valign="top">love the details of the insect! Nice background! - 8 -</td>', 'love the details of the insect! Nice background! - 8 -', '2007-04-20 10:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3565610, 495996, 69368, '<td valign="top">Great capture! Like the details of the butterfly! The plants on the right and in the background work very good. Great focus! Well done! Good luck!</td>', 'Great capture! Like the details of the butterfly! The plants on the right and in the background work very good. Great focus! Well done! Good luck!', '2007-04-20 10:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3565614, 497762, 69368, '<td valign="top">great details in the fly! -7-</td>', 'great details in the fly! -7-', '2007-04-20 10:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3565615, 497453, 69368, '<td valign="top">very nice composition! Love the colors and the details! - 7 -</td>', 'very nice composition! Love the colors and the details! - 7 -', '2007-04-20 10:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3565617, 498074, 69368, '<td valign="top">A tad too brightly in all. Otherwise nice composition! Like the sky in the background! - 7 -</td>', 'A tad too brightly in all. Otherwise nice composition! Like the sky in the background! - 7 -', '2007-04-20 10:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3565673, 498005, 72194, '<td valign="top">heh</td>', 'heh', '2007-04-20 11:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3565699, 497465, 77328, '<td valign="top">I love the sharpness of the photo. However, I would like to have seen the image cropped a little closer around the butterfly so that it would fill ethe frame a bit more. But overall nice colors and great use of Depth of field.</td>', 'I love the sharpness of the photo. However, I would like to have seen the image cropped a little closer around the butterfly so that it would fill ethe frame a bit more. But overall nice colors and great use of Depth of field.', '2007-04-20 11:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3565703, 496845, 77328, '<td valign="top">I love this one! Kinda grewsome (sp?) looking but very nice with the backlight and the transparancy of the shell. I do kinda get a sense of it not being in focus as much as it could....but that may just be me.</td>', 'I love this one! Kinda grewsome (sp?) looking but very nice with the backlight and the transparancy of the shell. I do kinda get a sense of it not being in focus as much as it could....but that may just be me.', '2007-04-20 11:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3565762, 497893, 63896, '<td valign="top">cool and the flowers all looks good!</td>', 'cool and the flowers all looks good!', '2007-04-20 11:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566049, 497190, 77328, '<td valign="top">WOW! This absolutely gorgeous! I love the colors. The only thing I could "whine" about is that the background could have been (slightly) more out of focus..... But again, I love the colors of the bugs!</td>', 'WOW! This absolutely gorgeous! I love the colors. The only thing I could "whine" about is that the background could have been (slightly) more out of focus..... But again, I love the colors of the bugs!', '2007-04-20 13:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566097, 496086, 56880, '<td valign="top">I get the sense, maybe from the angle of the wings, that the bug is about to take off.  The detail in those wings is very sharp, and nicely lit; they look like shattered windows.</td>', 'I get the sense, maybe from the angle of the wings, that the bug is about to take off.  The detail in those wings is very sharp, and nicely lit; they look like shattered windows.', '2007-04-20 13:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566232, 496595, 67258, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Certainly made me smile.</td>', 'LOL!  Certainly made me smile.', '2007-04-20 14:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566238, 497418, 36133, '<td valign="top">Well-placed DOF</td>', 'Well-placed DOF', '2007-04-20 14:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566244, 498074, 70179, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Has a larger than life feel to it.</td>', 'Beautiful. Has a larger than life feel to it.', '2007-04-20 14:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566267, 497256, 42100, '<td valign="top">Love the DOF in this, it gives it a very dreamy quality.  The colors that are very rich and vivid add to the dreaminess as well.  Excellent!</td>', 'Love the DOF in this, it gives it a very dreamy quality.  The colors that are very rich and vivid add to the dreaminess as well.  Excellent!', '2007-04-20 15:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566273, 495250, 42100, '<td valign="top">The colors and detail is amazing in this macro.  Very cool subject matter as well, you must of hunted about for awhile to find this.  Excellent!</td>', 'The colors and detail is amazing in this macro.  Very cool subject matter as well, you must of hunted about for awhile to find this.  Excellent!', '2007-04-20 15:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566288, 497672, 42100, '<td valign="top">This is very ethereal with the shallow DOF.  The color and tones are excellent, as is the detail.  This photo just about puts me into a dreamlike state.  Outstanding!</td>', 'This is very ethereal with the shallow DOF.  The color and tones are excellent, as is the detail.  This photo just about puts me into a dreamlike state.  Outstanding!', '2007-04-20 15:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566305, 498145, 42100, '<td valign="top">That is a very narrow, narrow DOF you have there.  But the ladybug is a real eyegrabber because of that.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'That is a very narrow, narrow DOF you have there.  But the ladybug is a real eyegrabber because of that.  Very nicely done!', '2007-04-20 15:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566310, 495996, 42100, '<td valign="top">Beautiful butterfly!  Its coloring makes it a real eyegrabber, and you set if off so nicely from the background.  Very nice!</td>', 'Beautiful butterfly!  Its coloring makes it a real eyegrabber, and you set if off so nicely from the background.  Very nice!', '2007-04-20 15:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566314, 495356, 42100, '<td valign="top">I''m always a big fan of the circle bokeh, it gives photos such a magical quality.  The legs of the skipper with your DOF really give this photo some nice depth.  Excellent!</td>', 'I''m always a big fan of the circle bokeh, it gives photos such a magical quality.  The legs of the skipper with your DOF really give this photo some nice depth.  Excellent!', '2007-04-20 15:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566319, 497893, 70179, '<td valign="top">Stunning</td>', 'Stunning', '2007-04-20 15:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566320, 498205, 42100, '<td valign="top">Striking colors on that moth(?), magical use of shallow DOF.  Focuses the attention on the face nicely, but doesnt''s obliterate the wings or the leaf it''s perched on.  Great job!</td>', 'Striking colors on that moth(?), magical use of shallow DOF.  Focuses the attention on the face nicely, but doesnt''s obliterate the wings or the leaf it''s perched on.  Great job!', '2007-04-20 15:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566324, 497080, 42100, '<td valign="top">Some amazingly beautiful moths and butterflies in this challenge, and this one is no exception.  Very striking!</td>', 'Some amazingly beautiful moths and butterflies in this challenge, and this one is no exception.  Very striking!', '2007-04-20 15:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566330, 497328, 42100, '<td valign="top">Those are some pretty crazy looking little bugs.  The color and tone in  this photo are nothing short of amazing.  Well done!</td>', 'Those are some pretty crazy looking little bugs.  The color and tone in  this photo are nothing short of amazing.  Well done!', '2007-04-20 15:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566336, 498143, 42100, '<td valign="top">Nice pleasant change of pace from all the macros in this challenge.  A very clever idea, and the composition is quite good.  Well done!</td>', 'Nice pleasant change of pace from all the macros in this challenge.  A very clever idea, and the composition is quite good.  Well done!', '2007-04-20 15:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566338, 496845, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very, very creepy and eery photograph.  But it''s definitely your skill in lighting this that makes it that way.  Great job!</td>', 'Very, very creepy and eery photograph.  But it''s definitely your skill in lighting this that makes it that way.  Great job!', '2007-04-20 15:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566340, 496086, 42100, '<td valign="top">The detail in the wings of dragonflies is always so fascinating when photographed well.  Nicely done!</td>', 'The detail in the wings of dragonflies is always so fascinating when photographed well.  Nicely done!', '2007-04-20 15:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566344, 497476, 42100, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure where this little guy is headed, but your use of negative space definitely makes it look like he has a very long way to go.  Nice use of the shallow DOF.  Great job!</td>', 'I''m not sure where this little guy is headed, but your use of negative space definitely makes it look like he has a very long way to go.  Nice use of the shallow DOF.  Great job!', '2007-04-20 15:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566403, 498070, 67152, '<td valign="top">one scaring looking creepy crawly - wish the light would have been better</td>', 'one scaring looking creepy crawly - wish the light would have been better', '2007-04-20 15:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566407, 497568, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice close up but the broken wings are a shame</td>', 'nice close up but the broken wings are a shame', '2007-04-20 15:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566690, 498237, 75893, '<td valign="top">I love how it looks like he is actually praying.</td>', 'I love how it looks like he is actually praying.', '2007-04-20 17:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566696, 498070, 75893, '<td valign="top">You are probably getting some people saying  DNMC, but in my mind, spiders are insects, they are creepy &amp; crawly and disgusting...for sure an insect.  Great photo!</td>', 'You are probably getting some people saying  DNMC, but in my mind, spiders are insects, they are creepy & crawly and disgusting...for sure an insect.  Great photo!', '2007-04-20 17:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566699, 498259, 75893, '<td valign="top">Wow, so many colors, I love it, one of my favorites!</td>', 'Wow, so many colors, I love it, one of my favorites!', '2007-04-20 17:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566704, 496161, 75893, '<td valign="top">I wish you could see all of his wings.</td>', 'I wish you could see all of his wings.', '2007-04-20 17:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566711, 498079, 75893, '<td valign="top">Wow, whoever''s eye this belongs to is very brave, I actually gasped when I saw this...great job!</td>', 'Wow, whoever''s eye this belongs to is very brave, I actually gasped when I saw this...great job!', '2007-04-20 17:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566713, 496986, 75893, '<td valign="top">I love this, he really looks like he''s grasping for the branch.</td>', 'I love this, he really looks like he''s grasping for the branch.', '2007-04-20 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566729, 495356, 75893, '<td valign="top">The reflections is great...it''s so clear.</td>', 'The reflections is great...it''s so clear.', '2007-04-20 17:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566736, 497960, 75893, '<td valign="top">Haha, that''s just wrong, I gotta give a high score, this had to have taken some patience.</td>', 'Haha, that''s just wrong, I gotta give a high score, this had to have taken some patience.', '2007-04-20 18:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566739, 497954, 75893, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture!</td>', 'Awesome capture!', '2007-04-20 18:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567226, 496845, 2158, '<td valign="top">Amazing lighting.  That thing seems to glow.</td>', 'Amazing lighting.  That thing seems to glow.', '2007-04-20 22:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567398, 498236, 61651, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent min edit macro and it completely gives me the heebie jeebies. :)</td>', 'This is an excellent min edit macro and it completely gives me the heebie jeebies. :)', '2007-04-20 23:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567402, 497893, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nicely angled composition and well-balanced with the flowers above and below.</td>', 'Nicely angled composition and well-balanced with the flowers above and below.', '2007-04-20 23:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567411, 496954, 61651, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this the more I like it.  I''m glad this is minimal editing - if you had the chance to pretty it up and take out all spots and artifacts, I don''t think I''d like it as much.  I originally voted this an 8 but bumping it to a 10.</td>', 'The more I look at this the more I like it.  I''m glad this is minimal editing - if you had the chance to pretty it up and take out all spots and artifacts, I don''t think I''d like it as much.  I originally voted this an 8 but bumping it to a 10.', '2007-04-20 23:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567453, 496180, 45524, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup, shame its a bit underexposed. And you have major Dust boogies! Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Nice closeup, shame its a bit underexposed. And you have major Dust boogies! Good luck with the challenge.', '2007-04-20 23:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567459, 497811, 23098, '<td valign="top">Colorful!</td>', 'Colorful!', '2007-04-21 00:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567463, 497960, 45524, '<td valign="top">OMG this is funny as all get out! I love this your getting a 10 from me just for making me laugh so hard and having a very creative setup.</td>', 'OMG this is funny as all get out! I love this your getting a 10 from me just for making me laugh so hard and having a very creative setup.', '2007-04-21 00:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567465, 497916, 23098, '<td valign="top">Very nice close-up and detail. The object above the insect takes my eye away from the subject a bit.</td>', 'Very nice close-up and detail. The object above the insect takes my eye away from the subject a bit.', '2007-04-21 00:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
