(3567811, 498121, 74371, '<td valign="top">I have been trying for years to get a shot similar to this... congratulations. There is nothing that I don''t like about this photo. The positioning, although going against the third''s rule, is perfect here... like Mr. Bee sat there in mid air waiting for your finger to punch the button. The background is not busy at all, and the shapes add to the shot instead of detracting in any way.<br/> <br/>I have seen alot of shots that are close to this... but for me... you captured this wonderfully!</td>', 'I have been trying for years to get a shot similar to this... congratulations. There is nothing that I don''t like about this photo. The positioning, although going against the third''s rule, is perfect here... like Mr. Bee sat there in mid air waiting for your finger to punch the button. The background is not busy at all, and the shapes add to the shot instead of detracting in any way. I have seen alot of shots that are close to this... but for me... you captured this wonderfully!', '2007-04-21 02:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3568106, 495848, 40386, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot.  I like the way the DOF falls off towards the last ants. The only thing I would have done differently is, it looks as if you tilted your flash to the left to take the shot which has thrown the shadow behind the ants and they are getting a bit lost, so I would have tilted the flash to the right in order to throw the shadow the other way and the ants would stand out better.</td>', 'This is a nice shot.  I like the way the DOF falls off towards the last ants. The only thing I would have done differently is, it looks as if you tilted your flash to the left to take the shot which has thrown the shadow behind the ants and they are getting a bit lost, so I would have tilted the flash to the right in order to throw the shadow the other way and the ants would stand out better.', '2007-04-21 09:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3568127, 497475, 43682, '<td valign="top">nice depth of field</td>', 'nice depth of field', '2007-04-21 09:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3568240, 497015, 51802, '<td valign="top">The DoF is to shallow.  I would prefer it better if the wingtips were in focus.</td>', 'The DoF is to shallow.  I would prefer it better if the wingtips were in focus.', '2007-04-21 10:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
