(3576924, 495996, 57882, '<td valign="top">This was much more than just a "try" for you, it was a home-run.  The colors are soft, but striking.  And the DOF is right on.  Just goes to show that your talent extends way beyond editing.  Good work.</td>', 'This was much more than just a "try" for you, it was a home-run.  The colors are soft, but striking.  And the DOF is right on.  Just goes to show that your talent extends way beyond editing.  Good work.', '2007-04-24 13:13:37.000000', NULL, 0);
