(3952987, 496783, 11769, '<td valign="top">It takes a special soul to see the meaning here. My brother Rick and I kept a little bee alive one winter. We found it moving so slow in mid Nov and brought it into the garage, had a box for it and every day we fed it sugar water. In the spring we brought him out on the deck and it took several times doing this before he moved forward and flew off. The feeling I got seeing him fly was well worth that long winter.</td>', 'It takes a special soul to see the meaning here. My brother Rick and I kept a little bee alive one winter. We found it moving so slow in mid Nov and brought it into the garage, had a box for it and every day we fed it sugar water. In the spring we brought him out on the deck and it took several times doing this before he moved forward and flew off. The feeling I got seeing him fly was well worth that long winter.', '2007-07-31 11:44:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3953372, 496783, 74979, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jmritz:</b></div><hr/><i> It takes a special soul to see the meaning here. My brother Rick and I kept a little bee alive one winter. We found it moving so slow in mid Nov and brought it into the garage, had a box for it and every day we fed it sugar water. In the spring we brought him out on the deck and it took several times doing this before he moved forward and flew off. The feeling I got seeing him fly was well worth that long winter. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I believe you &amp; your brother are a <i>shoein </i>for heaven John!</td>', 'Originally posted by jmritz: It takes a special soul to see the meaning here. My brother Rick and I kept a little bee alive one winter. We found it moving so slow in mid Nov and brought it into the garage, had a box for it and every day we fed it sugar water. In the spring we brought him out on the deck and it took several times doing this before he moved forward and flew off. The feeling I got seeing him fly was well worth that long winter.   I believe you & your brother are a shoein for heaven John!', '2007-07-31 14:09:42.000000', NULL, 0),
